{"code":"E6","wikidata":"Q4924220","wikipedia":{"en":"Thong Lo BTS station","th":"สถานีทองหล่อ"},"summary":{"en":"Thong Lo station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Khlong Toei and Watthana Districts, Bangkok, Thailand. The station opened in December 1999 along with the rest of the Sukhumvit Line's first phase. The elevated station is located on Sukhumvit Road at Soi Thong Lo (Sukhumvit Soi 55).","th":"สถานีทองหล่อ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนสุขุมวิทบริเวณปากซอยสุขุมวิท 55 ในพื้นที่เขตวัฒนาและเขตคลองเตย กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/BTS_Thong_Lo_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_Thong_Lo_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Thong_Lo_Station.jpg","author":"Andy & Anna Kelk","license":"CC BY 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/EMU-B3_77.jpg/960px-EMU-B3_77.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:EMU-B3_77.jpg","author":"Wasin147","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Fifty_Fifth_Tower%2C_residential_condominium_in_Thonglor.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fifty_Fifth_Tower,_residential_condominium_in_Thonglor.jpg","author":"soonthorn srichomkwan","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Khlong_Tan_Nuea%2C_Watthana%2C_Bangkok_10110%2C_Thailand_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg/960px-Khlong_Tan_Nuea%2C_Watthana%2C_Bangkok_10110%2C_Thailand_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khlong_Tan_Nuea,_Watthana,_Ban